        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Dobkin, Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Jackie Chan, Owen Wilson, Ben Stiller, Tom Wu\n- Works: Shanghai Knights, Revolver, Batman Begins, Ra.One, Cars franchise\n- Topics: Frat Pack comedies, voice acting, martial arts\n\nFacts:\n- David Dobkin directed Shanghai Knights, and Alfred Gough and Miles Millar wrote it.\n- Jackie Chan and Owen Wilson starred in Shanghai Knights.\n- Owen Wilson starred with Ben Stiller in numerous films.\n- Owen Wilson is known for roles in Frat Pack comedies.\n- Owen Wilson voiced Lightning McQueen in the Cars franchise.\n- Tom Wu is a martial arts expert.\n- Tom Wu appeared in the films Revolver, Shanghai Knights, Batman Begins, and Ra.One.",
